- [ ] **Website Uptime Monitor** — Live / Instrument — Show endpoint state, recent checks, and a compact incident history. **Visual:** tiny server-rack status panel with restrained alarm color.
- [ ] **Digital Pet** — Playful / Skin — Maintain a persistent creature through small care interactions and elapsed time. **Visual:** expressive Tamagotchi-inspired shell with a monochrome creature display.
- [ ] **Mini Music Player** — Music / Skin — Manage a short queue with playback, seek, volume, and now-playing state. **Visual:** translucent early-2000s MP3 player.
